sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapPeripheralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapPeripheral]

    Note over App, Node: Assume the Node currently has 2 bonds stored.

    App->>Node: GapPeripheral.RemoveBondWithAddress(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress})
    Node-->>App: GapPeripheralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)

    Note over App: NumberOfBondsChanged reports<br>the current bond count after removal (N-1).
